{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>太子發生墮樓案。今日（29日）凌晨2時許，警方接獲一名男子報案指，其年約19歲兒子在彌敦道745至747號金都中心墮樓，跌落大廈平台，救護員接報到場，事主一度有呼吸和脈搏，半清醒由救護車送往廣華醫院進行搶救，最終不治，警方正調查事件。</p><p>就現場所見，警員正翻查大廈閉路電視調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"警員翻查大廈閉路電視調查。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260829/1170231032205938688123084.jpeg/0UQDd74bvGK0A2Ru5GHoxiu2xsl3mJTPC5hEuzGYRLs\"/><figcaption>警員翻查大廈閉路電視調查。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260829/1170231026153295872309756.jpeg/iX22BE87GjebsDaisx46kYcW8qUYlKhLQBH9CHoR_Qg\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260829/1170231023150043136805926.jpeg/8cO2Mo4SmazsZedssgIOocHOBl1rkhwXq0RlvZFEZb0\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場為彌敦道745至747號金都中心。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260829/1170231029412401152042963.jpeg/uHrUdyzfcgucvC9639Rr667kS-2QBBa90cz24uvM9uI\"/><figcaption>現場為彌敦道745至747號金都中心。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T21:18:35.456947+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}